$TOYO The White House is listing TOYO as one of Trump&#39;s wins in Texas.

Their Oct 7 release: &quot;Toyo Co. announced a $357 million investment to build a solar cell manufacturing facility near Houston, creating 400 American jobs.&quot;

TOYO is #3 of 24 companies on the White House Texas page, next to $TM, $SPCX, $MU and $TSLA.

Commerce sent Under Secretary Kessler to the ribbon cutting, and he called it &quot;the direct result of the Trump Administration&#39;s bold policies.&quot;

